# BehaviorDEPOT demo data

This folder contains tracking files, annotations, and selected analyzed outputs
for the BehaviorDEPOT demos. Download the associated source videos from the
[demo-data archive](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VNv9FuXyiI4xgt-RokcVvWk-1dBovuqO?usp=sharing).

For demo descriptions, required settings, calibration values, and workflow
instructions, see the [Demo Data page in the BehaviorDEPOT
Wiki](https://github.com/DeNardoLab/BehaviorDEPOT/wiki/Demo-Data).

For the complete user guide, begin at the
[BehaviorDEPOT Wiki](https://github.com/DeNardoLab/BehaviorDEPOT/wiki).
